{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-153051","model_call":13,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"target loss prevention policy\" fines penalties)"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"target loss prevention policy\" fines penalties)"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#0_3321144158","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1256","rank":1,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#0_3321144158\" , \"end_char\": 1146.000000 , \"headings\": \"<cover>Target Loss Prevention Policy: Fines, Legal Penalties, </cover>etc Target Loss Prevention Policy: Fines, Legal Penalties, etc Table of Contents Target Loss Prevention Policy General Target Loss Prevention Policy Suspect Apprehension Legal Penalties: Target Shoplifting Fines and More Other Store Shoplifting Policies \" , \"segment\": \"Target Loss Prevention Policy: Fines, Legal Penalties, etc - First Quarter Finance Target Loss Prevention Policy: Fines, Legal Penalties, etc https://firstquarterfinance.com/target-loss-prevention-policy/ Cathy Desmet | Published Aug 26, 2019 Short Answer: Target’s asset protection and security specialists are responsible for theft prevention and recovery of Target merchandise and equipment. The team designs their processes to ensure the safety of employees and customers. Target stores also use security cameras and work closely with the local police in an effort to prevent shoplifting. For more information on the Target loss prevention policy, see below. Table of Contents Target Loss Prevention Policy General Target Loss Prevention Policy Suspect Apprehension Legal Penalties: Target Shoplifting Fines and More Other Store Shoplifting Policies","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#0_3321144158","rank":1,"relevance":3}]},"time":47},"model_calls":13,"document_judgments":8,"relevance_3":6,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
