{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-153051","model_call":55,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ target shoplifting charges)"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ target shoplifting charges)"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_713147205#3_1334542030","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1293","rank":1,"snippet":"doc_45_713147205#3_1334542030\" , \"end_char\": 2581.000000 , \"headings\": \"Retail Theft: Charges, Penalties and Defenses Retail Theft: Charges, Penalties and Defenses What is Retail Theft? Contents Is Retail Theft the Same as Shoplifting? What Happens if I am Arrested for Retail Theft? What Are the Penalties for Retail Theft? Are There any Defenses to Retail Theft? Do I Need to Hire an Attorney for Retail Theft <cover>Charges? \" , \"segment\": \"In particular, these laws aim to curb crime rings that target retail establishments with the intent to steal items that are then later resold online. Contents Is Retail Theft the Same as Shoplifting? </cover>What Happens if I am Arrested for Retail Theft? What Are the Penalties for Retail Theft? Are There any Defenses to Retail Theft? Do I Need to Hire an Attorney for Retail Theft Charges? Is Retail Theft the Same as Shoplifting? For the most part, the terms “retail theft” and “shoplifting” are basically synonymous and thus are often used interchangeably. However, there are in fact a few significant differences between the two crimes. For one, retail theft may apply to "},"time":173},"model_calls":55,"document_judgments":24,"relevance_3":7,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
