{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-153051","model_call":80,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ target shoplifting \"law enforcement\")"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ target shoplifting \"law enforcement\")"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#2_3321147942","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1317","rank":1,"snippet":"Policy General Target Loss Prevention Policy Suspect Apprehension Legal Penalties: Target Shoplifting Fines and More Other Store Shoplifting Policies \" , \"segment\": \"Each store also has a dedicated staffing budget for asset protection and security employees who identify and apprehend shoplifting suspects. General Target Loss Prevention Policy We called stores in Arkansas, California, Florida, Michigan, Minnesota, and New York for more information on the Target shoplifting policy at the store level. While most locations were unwilling to provide information due to safety and security concerns, representatives did share that <cover>Target works closely with local law enforcement. We were told that all shoplifting </cover>suspects will be arrested and prosecuted if proven guilty. Shoplifters will be responsible for all criminal fines and legal fees they incur as a result of their arrest. Target shoplifting fines and fees for each individual incident will vary by state and degree of crime severity. Asset protection specialists at Target are responsible for keeping thorough documentation of each shoplifting incident at their store. They also work to identify shoplifting trends occurring within the store — such as whether shoplifters are targeting certain items — and to conduct internal theft investigations if necessary. Target’s security ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#2_3321147942","rank":1,"relevance":3}]},"time":103},"model_calls":80,"document_judgments":31,"relevance_3":7,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
{"actor":"server","event":"request","topic_id":"2024-153051","model_call":80,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1317"},"model_calls":80,"document_judgments":31,"relevance_3":7,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-153051","model_call":80,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1317"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q1317"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#1_3321145933","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1317","rank":2,"snippet":"Store Shoplifting Policies Target Loss Prevention Policy Target’s loss prevention policy includes the use of video surveillance systems to help control theft and assist in the recovery of stolen merchandise, a corporate customer service associate said. This applies both inside and outside the store on Target property. Each store also has a dedicated staffing budget for asset protection and security employees who identify and apprehend shoplifting suspects. General Target Loss Prevention Policy We called stores in Arkansas, California, Florida, Michigan, Minnesota, and New York for more information on the Target shoplifting policy at the store level. While most locations were unwilling to provide information due to safety and security concerns, representatives did share that <cover>Target works closely with local law enforcement. We were told that all shoplifting </cover>suspects will be arrested and prosecuted if proven guilty. Shoplifters will be responsible for all criminal fines and legal fees they incur as a result of their arrest.\" , \"start_char\": 477.000000 , \"title\": \"Target Loss Prevention Policy: Fines, Legal Penalties, etc - First Quarter Finance\" , \"url\": \"https://firstquarterfinance.com/target-loss-prevention-policy/\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#1_3321145933","rank":2,"relevance":3}]},"time":2},"model_calls":80,"document_judgments":31,"relevance_3":7,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
